WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.628
God gave John Paul the strength

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:05.880
to be an unforgettable human being.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.173
Let us give thanks 

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.300
for the joy he spread his whole life long.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.387
Everything bad that could have happened 

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:14.723
has happened.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.601
Except that.

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:24.566
Who knows if there’s foul play here but if there is 

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:26.276
the culprit usually shows up at the funeral.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.153
Alright, Columbo.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.696
Mclauchlan and Sons

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.948
We’re handling John Paul’s life insurance policy.

00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:33.074
Were you very close?

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:34.576
Yeah,  he was our brother in law.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:36.202
My condolences Mrs. Winns.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.371
Oh egg and onion!

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.164
It’s like you knew I was coming.

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:41.416
Did ya?

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:43.460
She can’t find out what we did.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.630
Do you like it?

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.007
Get a grip of yourself!

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.093
I know you don’t think he’s a good man!

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:53.845
Families they're

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:54.637
complex.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.181
I’m warning you.

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:59.434
She doesn’t respect you

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:00.727
because you’re weak.

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:07.650
She wasn’t always like that 

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.819
 he’s sucking the life out of her

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:11.154
Well we’ll just have to wait

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.697
until he dies of cancer or something.

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:14.199
Why not give nature a helping hand?

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:19.454
You’re talking about taking a man’s life!

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:20.872
Not a man

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:23.124
that monster!

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:27.253
That’s

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:27.962
demented.

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:32.634
You’re going to land yourselves and me in jail!

00:01:35.303 --> 00:01:37.639
I’m hungry are you?

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:39.516
No!

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:41.351
There’s no evidence 

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:42.435
we should be looking for fraud

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:43.353
Murder is fraud 

00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:44.854
when there’s a life policy to pay up 

00:01:45.814 --> 00:01:46.564
It’s not happening

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:48.358
It was one moment of madness

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.318
Two moments of madness

00:01:53.196 --> 00:01:54.030
You’re vile

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:54.989
do you know that

00:02:02.038 --> 00:02:03.748
You can’t just explode a man

00:02:08.169 --> 00:02:10.129
He thinks someone is trying to kill him

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:11.256
That's insane!

